<title>CHILE: Chile supermarket chain D&amp;S Q1 net climbs.</title>
<headline>Chile supermarket chain D&amp;S Q1 net climbs.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Supermarket group D&amp;S reported the following earnings in the first quarter of the year.</p>
<p>			    Q1 1997	   Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit		   4.14		1.98</p>
<p>Operating income	   3.57		0.66</p>
<p>Non-operating income     0.92		1.36</p>
<p>Total revenues	    80.58	     63.27</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos. ((--Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
